tive Adversarial Networks. 2019 IEEE\/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), IEEE.","DOI":"10.1109\/CVPR.2019.00453"},{"key":"ref_13","unstructured":"Bai, S., Chen, K., Liu, X., Wang, J., Ge, W., Song, S., Dang, K., Wang, P., Wang, S., and Tang, J. (2025). Qwen2.5-VL Technical Report. arXiv."},{"key":"ref_14","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Wang, S.Y., Wang, O., Zhang, R., Owens, A., and Efros, A.A. (2020). CNN-generated images are surprisingly easy to spot... for now. IEEE\/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, IEEE.","DOI":"10.1109\/CVPR42600.2020.00872"},{"key":"ref_15","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Lanzino, R., Fontana, F., Diko, A., Marini, M.R., and Cinque, L. (2024). Faster than lies: Real-time deepfake detection using binary neural networks. IEEE\/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, IEEE.","DOI":"10.1109\/CVPRW63382.2024.00381"},{"key":"ref_16","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Agarwal, A., and Ratha, N. (2024). Deepfake catcher: Can a simple fusion be effective and outperform complex dnns?. IEEE\/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, IEEE.","DOI":"10.1109\/CVPRW63382.2024.00383"},{"key":"ref_17","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Lin, L., He, X., Ju, Y., Wang, X., Ding, F., and Hu, S. (2024). Preserving fairness generalization in deepfake detection. IEEE\/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, IEEE.","DOI":"10.1109\/CVPR52733.2024.01591"},{"key":"ref_18","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Ciamarra, A., Caldelli, R., and Del Bimbo, A. (2024). Temporal surface frame anomalies for deepfake video detection. IEEE\/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, IEEE.","DOI":"10.1109\/CVPRW63382.2024.00388"},{"key":"ref_19","doi-asserted-by":"crossref","unstructured":"Baraldi, L., Cocchi, F., Cornia, M., Baraldi, L., Nicolosi, A., and Cucchiara, R. (2024). Contrasting deepfakes diffus